{
  "project": {
    "name": "Bra Underwire + Tip Cap",
    "slug": "bra-underwire",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A 3D-printed underwire arc and the pair of tip caps that protect its ends — the rigid hard good the Fashion Cabinet `bra-underwire` notion places and bridges to here for its geometry. The arc shapes and supports a wired cup; the caps stop the wire working through the channel. Sized so a garment's finished cup width drives the finding.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Un arco de varilla impreso en 3D con el par de topes que protegen sus puntas — el herraje rígido que el avío `bra-underwire` de Fashion Cabinet coloca y al que se puentea aquí. El arco da forma y sostén a la copa con varilla; los topes evitan que la varilla perfore el túnel. Dimensionado para que el ancho terminado de copa determine el avío.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/bra-underwire.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
